Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/list.c
Line: 716
Function: collect_skeymanagers
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: sk_EVP_SKEYMGMT_new() in list_skeymanagers() (line 723) is not checked for NULL. A NULL km_stack is passed through EVP_SKEYMGMT_do_all_provided() to collect_skeymanagers(), which then calls sk_EVP_SKEYMGMT_push(km_stack, km) and dereferences the NULL pointer.

